The two `AVBPrint` ownership forms appear correct: one finalizes owned storage, while the caller-buffer form frees only the descriptor. I found metadata/documentation errors to correct: the sizing helper was assigned `AVBPrint`’s ownership rules even though C never instantiates it, and the claim that every `AVClass` is static overlooks a stack-local logging descriptor. I’m also checking allocation-failure paths and coverage.
