codex
The new tests cover the previously missed descriptor-allocation failure path, bringing Rust `bprint.rs` region coverage to 100%. ASan/UBSan, TSan, and Miri checks have passed for the exercised paths; BSan is still running. I also fixed a compile-fail doctest that accidentally tested cloning a reference rather than the `BPrint` owner. No runtime UB or equivalence defect has been confirmed.
